node_modules/

# package.json IS tracked, deliberately. The font it builds is a committed
# binary, so the versions that produced it have to be recorded somewhere or
# nobody can rebuild the same bytes. Leaving it untracked cost an afternoon
# once: the versions had to be guessed, the guess resolved simple-icons to a
# major that no longer carried one of the brand logos, and build.py died on a
# missing file with no hint that a version was the cause.
#
# The lockfile stays out. Exact versions are pinned in package.json already,
# and a 200KB lockfile for three build-time dependencies is noise.
package-lock.json
